      "content": "Here's an updated version of the quick-start guide with more detailed sub-sections and bullet points:\n\n**Nexus-7 LiDAR Module Quick Start Guide**\n\n**Introduction**\n\nThis guide provides a step-by-step introduction to the Nexus-7 LiDAR module, covering essential safety precautions, installation, and initial setup.\n\n**Technical Specifications**\n\n* Voltage: 12V-24V DC\n* Power Connection: 4-pin aviation connector\n* Mounting Holes: M3 screw holes\n* Operating LEDs: Green LED ( indications of module operation and status)\n\n**Pre-Installation Checklist**\n\n* Ensure the module is packaged and handled with care to prevent physical damage.\n* Verify that the 4-pin aviation connector is compatible with the module's power supply.\n\n**Installation and Mounting**\n\n1.1. Mount the module to a stable surface using the provided M3 screw holes.\n1.2. Securely fasten the module to the mounting surface to prevent vibration or movement.\n\n* Be aware of local environmental factors such as temperature, humidity, and magnetic interference that may affect module performance.\n\n**Safety Warnings**\n\n* Avoid direct contact with the lens during module operation, as this can cause damage to the sensor or injury to the operator",
